{"id": "22-4802-2-2", "zh": "tan 等词根类（Tanādigaṇa）", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "22-4803-2-5", "zh": "下面讲 tan 等词根类。", "confidence": 88}
{"id": "22-4804-2-9", "zh": "āpa、kara、tana、saka。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "22-4805-2-35", "zh": "680. Tanāditvo（tan 等之后加 o）［ka.451；rū.520；nī.932；caṃ.1.1.97；pā.3.1.79］。", "confidence": 82}
{"id": "22-4806-2-6", "zh": "在 tan 等词根之后加 o 词缀。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-4807-2-3", "zh": "tanoti。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "22-4808-2-4", "zh": "āpa 义为“到达”，带前缀 pa。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-4808-5-13", "zh": "词根末辅音重叠，并且元音变短：pappoti、papponti。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "22-4809-2-5", "zh": "被动语态：pāpīyati、pāpīyanti。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-4810-2-5", "zh": "使役：pāpeti、pāpayati。", "confidence": 88}
{"id": "22-4811-2-6", "zh": "被动语态：pāpīyati、pāpīyanti 等。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-4812-2-7", "zh": "kara 义为“做”：karoti、karonti。", "confidence": 88}
{"id": "22-4813-2-5", "zh": "被动语态：karīyati、karīyanti。", "confidence": 88}
{"id": "22-4814-2-21", "zh": "依照“tavagga、va、ra、ṇa 在 ya 前分别变为 cavagga、ba、ya、ña”这条规则，在 ya 之前，词根末音变为 y：kayyati、kayyanti、kayyare、kayyate、kayyante。", "confidence": 72}
{"id": "22-4815-2-17", "zh": "使役：kāreti、kārayati、kārenti、kārayanti、kārāpeti、kārāpayati、kārāpenti、kārāpayanti。", "confidence": 88}
{"id": "22-4816-2-21", "zh": "681. Karassa sossa kuṃ（带 o 的 kara 变为 kuṃ）［ka.511；rū.521；nī.1124］。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "22-4817-2-10", "zh": "带 o 音的 kara，在后面接 mi、ma 语尾时，变为 kuṃ。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "22-4818-2-36", "zh": "kummi、kumma，圣典中有“bhattu apacitiṃ kummi”（我向丈夫表示敬意）［jā.1.3.126］、“dhammassāpacitiṃ kummi”（我向法表示敬意）［jā.2.22.1752］的用例。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "22-4819-2-20", "zh": "682. Karotissa kho（karoti 变为 kha）［ka.594；rū.582；nī.1198］。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "22-4820-2-8", "zh": "在前缀之后的词根 kara，有时变为 kha。", "confidence": 78}
{"id": "22-4821-2-9", "zh": "saṅkharoti、saṅkharonti、abhisaṅkharoti、abhisaṅkharonti。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "22-4822-2-5", "zh": "被动语态：saṅkharīyati、saṅkharīyanti。", "confidence": 88}
{"id": "22-4823-2-5", "zh": "使役：saṅkhāreti、saṅkhārayati。", "confidence": 88}
{"id": "22-4824-2-9", "zh": "在 ṇāpi 词缀前不作元音增强：saṅkharāpeti、saṅkharāpayati。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "22-4825-2-5", "zh": "被动语态：saṅkhārīyati、saṅkharāpīyati。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-4826-2-37", "zh": "683. Karassa sossa kubbakurukayirā（带 o 的 kara 变为 kubba、kuru、kayira）［ka.511-2；rū.521-2；nī.1077-8-9-10；caṃ.5.2.103；pā.6.4.110］。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "22-4827-2-21", "zh": "带 o 音的 kara，在 nta、māna、ti 等语尾之前，可以变为 kubba、kuru、kayira；依照大规则（mahāvutti），ku 可任意变为 kru。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "22-4828-2-9", "zh": "kubbati、kubbanti、krubbati、krubbanti。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "22-4829-2-27", "zh": "后组语尾（parachakka）：kubbate、krubbate、kubbante、krubbante、kurute、kayirati、kayiranti、kayirasi、kayiratha、kayirāmi、kayirāma、kayirate、kayirante。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "22-4830-2-27", "zh": "karotu、saṅkharotu、kubbatu、krubbatu、kurutu，例如“agghaṃ kurutu no bhavaṃ”（请尊者接受我们的供物）［dī.ni.2.318］，kayiratu。", "confidence": 72}
{"id": "22-4831-2-11", "zh": "kareyya、saṅkhareyya、kubbeyya、krubbeyya、kayireyya。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "22-4832-2-19", "zh": "684. Ṭā（变为 ṭā）［ka.517；rū.488；nī.1105］。", "confidence": 78}
{"id": "22-4833-2-9", "zh": "在替代形 kayira 之后，语尾 eyya 可以变为带 ṭ 附标的 ā。", "confidence": 78}
{"id": "22-4834-2-28", "zh": "so puññaṃ kayirā（他应当造福），例如“puññaṃ ce puriso kayirā”（人如果造福）［dha.pa.118］、“kayirā naṃ punappunaṃ”（应当一再地去做）［dha.pa.118］。", "confidence": 78}
{"id": "22-4835-2-19", "zh": "685. Kayireyyasseyyumādīnaṃ（kayira 之后 eyyuṃ 等语尾的 eyya）［ka.517；rū.488；nī.1083-4-5-6-7］。", "confidence": 72}
{"id": "22-4836-2-8", "zh": "在替代形 kayira 之后，eyyuṃ 等语尾中的 eyya 一音节被省略。", "confidence": 78}
{"id": "22-4837-2-21", "zh": "kayiruṃ、kayireyyuṃ、kayirāsi、kayireyyāsi、kayirātha、kayireyyātha、kayirāmi、kayireyyāmi、kayirāma、kayireyyāma。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "22-4838-2-19", "zh": "686. Ethassā（etha 变为 ā）［ka.517；rū.488；nī.1082］。", "confidence": 78}
{"id": "22-4839-2-9", "zh": "在替代形 kayira 之后，语尾 etha 中的 e 音可以变为 ā。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "22-4840-2-35", "zh": "so kayirātha，例如“dīpaṃ kayirātha paṇḍito”（智者应当为自己建立洲渚）［dha.pa.28］、“kayirā ce kayirāthenaṃ”（如果要做，就应当去做）［dha.pa.313；saṃ.ni.1.89］。", "confidence": 74}
{"id": "22-4841-2-55", "zh": "在 ī 等语尾中：akari、kari、saṅkhari、abhisaṅkhari、akubbi、kubbi、akrubbi、krubbi、akayiri、kayiri、akaruṃ、karuṃ、saṅkharuṃ、abhisaṅkharuṃ、akariṃsu、kariṃsu、saṅkhariṃsu、abhisaṅkhariṃsu、akubbiṃsu、kubbiṃsu、akrubbiṃsu、krubbiṃsu、akayiriṃsu、kayiriṃsu、akayiruṃ、kayiruṃ。", "confidence": 82}
{"id": "22-4842-2-20", "zh": "687. Kā īādīsu（在 ī 等语尾前变为 kā）［ka.491；rū.523；nī.983］。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "22-4843-2-8", "zh": "在 ī 等语尾之前，带 o 音的 kara 可以变为 kā。", "confidence": 82}
{"id": "22-4844-2-20", "zh": "688. Dīghā īssa（长音之后的 ī）［ka.517；rū.488；nī.1105］。", "confidence": 78}
{"id": "22-4845-2-12", "zh": "在长音 ā、e、ū 之后，语尾 ī 可以变为 si。", "confidence": 82}
{"id": "22-4846-2-16", "zh": "aṭṭhāsi、adāsi、vadesi、vajjesi、bhāvesi、kāresi、anubhosi、ahosi 等。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-4847-2-26", "zh": "so akāsi，te akaṃsu；偈颂中有“akaṃsu satthuvacanaṃ”（他们遵行了导师的话）［jā.2.22.564］的圣典用例。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "22-4847-27-31", "zh": "akāsuṃ，tvaṃ akāsi。", "confidence": 88}
{"id": "22-4847-32-54", "zh": "例如“mā tumhe evarūpaṃ akattha”（你们不要做这样的事）［出处待考］、“mākattha pāpakaṃ kammaṃ, āvī vā yadi vā raho”（不论公开还是隐秘，都不要造恶业）［udā.44］。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "22-4847-55-64", "zh": "akāsittha，ahaṃ akāsiṃ，mayaṃ akāsimhā、akamhā。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-4847-65-80", "zh": "例如“bhogesu vijjamānesu, dīpaṃ nākamha attano”（财富还在的时候，我们没有为自己建立洲渚）［jā.1.4.53］。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "22-4847-81-83", "zh": "so akā。", "confidence": 88}
{"id": "22-4847-84-106", "zh": "例如“tato ekasataṃ khatye, anuyante bhavaṃ akā”（于是尊者使一百零一位刹帝利成为随从）［jā.2.20.94］的圣典用例。", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "22-4847-107-115", "zh": "或者 akāsittha；ahaṃ akaṃ，或者 akaraṃ。", "confidence": 82}
{"id": "22-4847-116-138", "zh": "例如“tassāhaṃ vacanaṃ nākaṃ, pitu vuddhassa bhāsitaṃ”（年迈的父亲所说的话，我没有照着去做）［jā.2.17.134］的圣典用例。", "confidence": 74}
{"id": "22-4848-2-20", "zh": "使役：so kāresi、kārayi、kārāpesi、kārāpayi，te kāresuṃ、kārayuṃ、kārāpesuṃ、kārāpayuṃ 等。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-4849-2-12", "zh": "karissati、saṅkharissati、kubbissati、krubbissati、kayirissati 等。", "confidence": 88}
{"id": "22-4850-2-32", "zh": "依照“harassa cāhaṃ sse”这条规则，kara 的 ra 音连同 ssa 一起变为 āha：kāhati、kāhanti，例如“kathaṃ kāhanti dārakā”（孩子们将怎么办）［jā.2.22.1849］。", "confidence": 68}
{"id": "22-4851-2-6", "zh": "插入 i 时：kāhiti、kāhinti 等。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "22-4851-7-10", "zh": "kāhasi、kāhatha。", "confidence": 88}
{"id": "22-4851-11-36", "zh": "例如“kāhāmi kusalaṃ bahuṃ”（我将行许多善）［jā.1.4.56］、“kāhāma puññasañcayaṃ”（我们将积聚福德）［apa.thera 1.1.401］。", "confidence": 76}
{"id": "22-4852-2-38", "zh": "依照“āīādīsu”这条经文的分句法（yogavibhāga），在 ssati 等语尾之前 kara 也变为 kā，在复辅音前变为短音：kassati、kassanti、kassasi、kassatha、kassāmi、kassāma，例如“kassaṃ purisakāriyaṃ”（我将尽男子汉应做的事）［jā.2.22.131］。", "confidence": 68}
{"id": "22-4853-2-6", "zh": "在 ssā 等语尾中：akāhā、akarissā 等。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "22-4854-2-5", "zh": "tanu 义为“扩展”：tanoti。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-4855-2-3", "zh": "后元音省略：tanonti。", "confidence": 78}
{"id": "22-4856-2-20", "zh": "689. Ovikaraṇassu parachakke（后组语尾前，o 中缀变为 u）［ka.511；rū.521；nī.1024］。", "confidence": 76}
{"id": "22-4857-2-7", "zh": "后面接后组语尾时，o 中缀（vikaraṇa）变为 u。", "confidence": 78}
{"id": "22-4858-2-5", "zh": "tanute、tanunte。", "confidence": 88}
{"id": "22-4859-2-9", "zh": "依照“yavā sare”这条规则，u 变为 v：tanvante。", "confidence": 78}
{"id": "22-4860-2-21", "zh": "690. Pubbachakke vā kvaci（前组语尾前，有时可以变）［ka.511；rū.521；nī.1024］。", "confidence": 76}
{"id": "22-4861-2-8", "zh": "在前组语尾之前，o 中缀有时可以变为 u。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "22-4862-2-5", "zh": "tanuti、kurutu。", "confidence": 88}
{"id": "22-4863-2-4", "zh": "为什么说“有时”？", "confidence": 88}
{"id": "22-4863-5-6", "zh": "例如 karoti。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-4864-2-5", "zh": "为什么说“可以”？", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-4864-6-7", "zh": "例如 tanoti。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-4865-2-5", "zh": "被动语态：tanīyati、taññati。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-4866-2-20", "zh": "691. Tanassā vā（tana 可以变为 ā）［ka.517；rū.488；nī.1105］。", "confidence": 76}
{"id": "22-4867-2-8", "zh": "在 kya 之前，词根 tana 的 n 音可以变为 ā。", "confidence": 80}
